      "translations": {
        "en": "From him, from his father, from Hariz, from Sinan, from Abu Abdillah (peace be upon him) who said: The Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him and his family) said: 'Verily, when Allah, the Exalted, created Adam (peace be upon him), He blew into him from His spirit. The first thing that was blown into him from His spirit was his intellect ('aql). Then He blew into him again, and the first thing Allah created from the intellect was sight.'"
